; POLYGON (0.8.1-PT36, #934): Esc at every prompt leaves no entity; the alias POL; one undo
; step Polygon, U and REDO. The Esc cases always type the proposals (4 sides, Inscribed), so
; what Esc keeps of them does not matter. Square inscribed in a circle of radius 10, by hand: even,
; so the first vertex is at 90 + 45 degrees.
POLYGON
!esc
POL
4
!esc
POLYGON
4
0,0
!esc
POLYGON
4
0,0
I
!esc
POLYGON
4
E
!esc
POLYGON
4
E
0,0
!esc
!report
POLYGON
4
0,0
I
10
!report
U
!report
REDO
